flowchart TB
    subgraph USER[Windows User Session]
        MGR[SplitOS Manager]
        GL[Game Launcher]
        RH[Runtime Host]
        UGW[User Persistence Gateway]
        PGW[Projection Gateway]
        BCLI[Broker Client]
    end

    subgraph USERFS[Per-user LocalAppData]
        UDB[(user.db\nUSER_CANONICAL\nWAL + FULL)]
        PDB[(projection.db\nPROJECTION_CACHE\nWAL + NORMAL)]
        UBAK[User Backups]
        SEC[Protected Secret Store\nseparate from SQLite]
    end

    subgraph MACHINE[Machine / Session 0]
        BROKER[SplitOS Broker Service\nLocalSystem]
        MSGW[Machine State Store]
    end

    subgraph MACHINEFS[ProgramData]
        MDB[(machine.db\nMACHINE_CANONICAL + TRANSACTION_DURABLE\nWAL + FULL)]
        MBAK[Machine Backups]
        STAGE[Update / Recovery Staging]
    end

    MGR -->|semantic IPC| RH
    GL -->|semantic IPC| RH

    RH --> UGW --> UDB
    UGW --> UBAK
    RH --> PGW --> PDB
    RH -->|secret reference| SEC

    RH --> BCLI
    BCLI -->|Named Pipe\ntyped StateStore capability| BROKER
    BROKER --> MSGW --> MDB
    MSGW --> MBAK
    BROKER --> STAGE

    PDB -. rebuild from .-> EXT[External Game Clients / Windows Evidence]

    classDef canonical stroke-width:2px;
    class UDB,MDB canonical;
